{"page": 16, "width": 960, "height": 540, "text": "Issued faces in eGramSwaraj and Audit Online\nSection :- Audit Online\nThere is no clear role segregation between generator of Draft Report and Approver in Audit Online\nplatform, unlike the existing manual practice of this office. Even if there is any, the ELA, the Approver,\nmust generate report, rather than approving/ modifying the same. This will only lead to unnecessary\ndelay as the ELA cannot be expected to generate the report after adding each component of the Report\nas stated above on each unit audited. Instead, the draft report must be generated by Editing Officer and\nsend to the approver via Audition line application with the privilege to either modify or approve it.\nHowever, the same is missing in the Audit Online application system.\nAfter generation of Audit Report using Audit Online platform, the system does not allow the Sr. Audit\nOfficer to make any modification in the Audit Report which are suggested by the ELA.\nDepartment of Panchayats & Rural Developement, W.B.", "words": [{"text": "Issued", "x0": 242.16, "x1": 321.91967999999997, "top": 37.493352000000016, "doctop": 8137.493352, "bottom": 61.51735200000002, "upright": true, "height": 24.024, "width": 79.75967999999997, "direction": "ltr"}, {"text": "faces", "x0": 330.08784, "x1": 393.439128, "top": 37.493352000000016, "doctop": 8137.493352, "bottom": 61.51735200000002, "upright": true, "height": 24.024, "width": 63.351287999999954, "direction": "ltr"}, {"text": "in", "x0": 401.607288, "x1": 426.592248, "top": 37.493352000000016, "doctop": 8137.493352, "bottom": 61.51735200000002, "upright": true, "height": 24.024, "width": 24.98496, "direction": "ltr"}, {"text": "eGramSwaraj", "x0": 434.69, "x1": 598.53368, "top": 37.493352000000016, "doctop": 8137.493352, "bottom": 61.51735200000002, "upright": true, "height": 24.024, "width": 163.84368, "direction": "ltr"}, {"text": "and", "x0": 606.34, "x1": 651.9578, "top": 37.493352000000016, "doctop